8. The period of a marketing authorisation in Georgia granted to a pharmaceutical product registered under the recognition regime of state registration shall be determined as per the period of marketing authorisation granted in a market subject to the control of a foreign or interstate state authority regulating pharmaceutical products but for not more than 5 years.
